# Line endings: LF in every blob and in every working copy, on every OS.
# A prebuilt deploy uploads the working copy, so without this a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf true) would serve public/ with other bytes than a
# Linux checkout: the case key document 2077 bytes instead of git's 2055
# (README "Deploy shape"; test/deploy_shape.test.js checks public/ for CR).
# No binary rules: every tracked file is text (git ls-files --eol: all i/lf).
* text=auto eol=lf
